<title>USA: Citicorp boosts share repurchase plan.</title>
<headline>Citicorp boosts share repurchase plan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citicorp said Tuesday its board expanded its share repurchase program by $4 billion to $8.5 billion through December 31, 1998.</p>
<p>Citicorp had an average of 485.6 million shares outstanding for the third quarter.</p>
